        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"4aee0d75-6901-426e-b0f7-11d042ccc73e\",\"review_text\":\"Good\"},{\"review_id\":\"2ffdf599-a0d5-4c01-bf26-025215d44c06\",\"review_text\":\"I like the app, but I don't like that it is always stuck downloading songs in the background and gets stuck until I open Spotify. Idk if it's clever marketing to get the user to open the app, or if it's a bug...either way it is very annoying and has forced me to consider canceling my premium after years of being a subscriber to Hulu/Spotify. I'm sure no one reads these reviews after reading a few of the others. Shame on you spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"33526c6f-7a49-4b3d-bd20-d1bc191c494c\",\"review_text\":\"RUDE APP , THIS APP SUPPORT GUYS 🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮. تطبيق سيء ، بدعم المثليين 🤮🤮🤮\"},{\"review_id\":\"51bfd887-24a0-4741-8b59-68e0a726dd7a\",\"review_text\":\"Disappointing\"},{\"review_id\":\"5c9c17d3-9d6a-4fa1-a2a4-ae98eefbbd25\",\"review_text\":\"Your new features are really bad thing that I found because it plays any song of the Playlist randomly it really really disappointing for and listeners who don't need disturbance in their song patterns. I apologise to your team for reverse your updated or change the new features to old features . Thanks 😊\"},{\"review_id\":\"e575daac-46ab-4da3-b9f5-723bf4000234\",\"review_text\":\"Noiceee\"},{\"review_id\":\"8737ac88-7e76-45ba-aa42-4eb97e3300ec\",\"review_text\":\"It's the best app ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"3e82cf28-6b0a-4980-902c-b6aa154d353a\",\"review_text\":\"Aakhir kar spotify ne bhi apni bhikaariyo vali aukaat dikha di \\\"Gadar karbe\\\" Chanda mangna got real Bhikaariyo ko training dena bhi shuru kardo haramiyo\"},{\"review_id\":\"ed15bb17-865a-492b-ba1b-268f4cab78f6\",\"review_text\":\"Very good app enna advertisement verudu premium best\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca16e65d-d2ff-4453-a495-b8c422809330\",\"review_text\":\"Recent update 👎\"}]}"
